      "content": "<!--\n  Poolside Portrait — 670×1200 JPEG from the HTML Library image set.\n  The width/height attributes reserve the box so the page does not shift\n  while the file downloads.\n-->\n<figure class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl\">\n  <img\n    src=\"https://xnsteam-ai.github.io/Html-library/images/2057857207178588375-1.jpg\"\n    alt=\"Poolside swimwear portrait with palm trees in the background\"\n    width=\"670\"\n    height=\"1200\"\n    class=\"h-auto w-full rounded-xl\"\n  />\n  <figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-[12px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Poolside Portrait · 670×1200</figcaption>\n</figure>\n"
